<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Guided Star-Shaped Masked Diffusion</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:119.2pt;">Viacheslav Meshchaninov<sup id="id1.1" class="ltx_sup">1,2*</sup></span>
</span></span>
