</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id7" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:119.2pt;">Nikita Balagansky<sup id="id7.1" class="ltx_sup">4</sup></span>
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id8" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:119.2pt;">Daniil Gavrilov<sup id="id8.1" class="ltx_sup">4</sup></span>
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
